    - Term: ID_HUB_GAMEBOY_CROSSPROMO_PLAY_WHATTHECLASH
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "Looking for more silly Triband games?\n\nPlay WHAT THE CLASH? on Apple Arcade"
      - "هل تبحث عن مزيد من ألعاب Triband الساخرة؟\n\nما رأيك بتجربة لعب WHAT THE CLASH؟ على Apple Arcade!"
      - "想要游玩 Triband 出品的更多沙雕游戏吗？\n\n快来在 Apple Arcade 平台游玩《WHAT THE CLASH?》吧！"
      - "在找更多 Triband 出品的超傻遊戲嗎？\n\n立即在 Apple Arcade 上遊玩《WHAT THE CLASH?》吧！"
      - "Wil je meer knotsgekke Triband-games spelen?\n\nSpeel dan WHAT THE CLASH? in Apple Arcade!"
      - "Vous voulez encore plus de jeux Triband rigolos ?\n\nAlors jouez à WHAT THE CLASH? sur Apple Arcade !"
      - "À la recherche d'autres jeux absurdes de Triband?\n\nAlors, jouez à WHAT THE CLASH? sur Apple Arcade!"
      - "Auf der Suche nach noch mehr albernen Triband-Spielen?\n\nDann spiel doch WHAT THE CLASH? auf Apple Arcade!"
      - "Vuoi giocare ad altri buffi giochi Triband?\n\nGioca a WHAT THE CLASH? su Apple Arcade!"
      - "他にもTribandのバカおもしろいゲームがあるよ？\n\nApple Arcadeで『WHAT THE CLASH』をプレイしてみて！"
      - "우스꽝스러운 Triband의 게임들을 더 해보고 싶으신가요?\n\n그렇다면 Apple Arcade에서 WHAT THE CLASH?를 플레이하세요!"
      - "Procuras mais jogos malucos da Triband?\n\nEntão joga WHAT THE CLASH? na Apple Arcade!"
      - "Quer mais jogos birutas da Triband?\n\nEntão jogue WHAT THE CLASH? no Apple Arcade!"
      - "Хотите больше забавных игр от Triband?\n\nТогда сыграйте в WHAT THE CLASH? в Apple Arcade!"
      - "¿Quieres más juegos absurdos de Triband?\n\n¡Pues juega a WHAT THE CLASH? en Apple Arcade!"
      - "Daha fazla komik Triband oyunu mu arıyorsun?\n\nO zaman Apple Arcade üzerinden WHAT THE CLASH? oyna!"
      - "Busques més jocs esbojarrats de Triband?\n\nAleshores, juga a WHAT THE CLASH? a Apple Arcade!"
      - "Letar du efter fler fåniga Triband-spel?\n\nDå kan du spela WHAT THE CLASH? på Apple Arcade!"
      - "กำลังมองหาเกม Triband สุดสนุกเพิ่มเติมใช่ไหม?\n\nงั้นมาเล่น WHAT THE CLASH ไหม? เจอกันที่ Apple Arcade!"
      Flags: 00000000000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
